@baseUrl = http://localhost:5225
@adminToken = replace-with-token-from-login
@restaurantId = 1

### Public list (active restaurants only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants

### Admin login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "admin",
  "password": "replace-with-the-configured-admin-password"
}

### Admin list (active and paused restaurants)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin get one restaurant
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin/{{restaurantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create a restaurant
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Bistro",
  "cuisine": "Modern European",
  "rating": 4.5,
  "deliveryTime": "25-35 min",
  "price": "$$",
  "imageKey": "italian",
  "isActive": true
}

### Update or pause a restaurant
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin/{{restaurantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "The Italian Place",
  "cuisine": "Italian • Pizza",
  "rating": 4.6,
  "deliveryTime": "30-40 min",
  "price": "$$",
  "imageKey": "italian",
  "isActive": false
}

### Delete a restaurant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin/{{restaurantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Not found example
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/restaurants/admin/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
